  <div class="callout callout--note">
    <span class="callout__heading">⚠ Important — please read first</span>
    <p>
      UK immigration rules change frequently and the consequences of getting it wrong can be
      serious. This guide gives you a general overview of common visa routes — it is
      <strong>not legal advice</strong> and should not be used as the basis for any visa
      application. Always check the official
      <a href="https://www.gov.uk/browse/visas-immigration" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gov.uk visa guidance</a>
      for the most current rules, fees and requirements before applying. For complex situations,
      consult a regulated immigration adviser (see the end of this guide).
    </p>
